         <div n="1">
            <head>Shiji I: Basic Annals</head>
            <p><title>Basic Annals of Qin</title>: In the <span corresp="fifty-third_year">fifty-third year</span>, all under Heaven <span corresp="came_to_pay_homage">came to pay homage</span>. <placeName n="10">Wei</placeName> was late; <placeName n="1">Qin</placeName> sent <persName n="2">Jiu</persName> to attack Wei and took <placeName n="100">Wucheng</placeName>. The <persName n="44">King of Han</persName> came to court, and Wei entrusted its state to Qin and took its orders.</p>
         </div>

      </body>
